## Phase 4 — `/speckit.clarify`

```
/speckit.clarify Prioritise: rounding and currency-conversion display rules; timezone
and cut-off for the as-of timestamp; behaviour when the nightly batch has not completed
or has failed; per-widget partial failure; the exact data differences between the
participant view and the administrator support view; and any interaction implied by the
Figma frames that is not navigation or filtering.
```

Answer every question. This is where stock-plan defects actually live — rounding and as-of
semantics are invisible in a Figma frame and expensive in production. The answers are written
back into `spec.md`.

