## Command cheat sheet

```
# ---- once per project ----
specify init workplaceiq-ui --integration copilot
# Phase 0, plain chat: get_metadata → get_variable_defs → create_design_system_rules
#                      → get_screenshot → get_design_context
#          producing design/figma-sources.md, tokens.json,
#          design-system-rules.md, screens/*.png, screen-inventory.md
