# ---- once per feature, starting with 001-app-shell ----
/speckit.specify        <what + why + Figma node references>
/speckit.clarify        <push on rounding, as-of, partial failure, roles>
/speckit.plan           <stack + design-context.md instructions + contract>
/speckit.checklist      <visual conformance>
/speckit.tasks
/speckit.analyze
/speckit.implement
#   → verify against Figma → walk checklists/visual.md → PR
```

