## Our demo feature

Everything from here uses one concrete WorkplaceIQ feature so the examples are real:

> **Feature 001 — Unified Equity Position & Engagement API.**
> A plan-sponsor admin opens the WorkplaceIQ dashboard and sees, for their company: total outstanding equity value, vested-but-unexercised value, participation rate, and a retention view comparing tenure of employees who have exercised versus those who have not — with data unified across Shareworks and E*TRADE.

This is a good demo because it touches every risk we care about: cross-provider semantics, aggregation rules, entitlement, and a UI contract.

